SUMMARY:Room 861 at Goodnights: Caitlin Peluffo
LOCATION:Goodnights Comedy Club\, 401 Woodburn Rd.\, Raleigh
DESCRIPTION:Originally hailing from San Francisco\, Caitlin Peluffo is a Ne
 w York based stand-up  comedian. She was in the final 4 for Kevin Hart’s
  Funny AF on Netflix\, gaining over 100k new  fans across the country and 
 a featuring spot on Nikki Glaser’s next tour. This lovable loose  cannon
  made her network television debut on The Late Show with Stephen Colbert\, 
 was  featured on the Late Late Show with James Corden\, and appeared on th
 e Tonight Show starring Jimmy Fallon where she received a standing ovation.
  She has been seen on  CBS’s After Midnight\, Comedy Central’s ‘Feat
 uring’ series\, and was a Just for Laughs New  Face in Montreal. She reg
 ularly opens for Matteo Lane and Fortune Feimster and has  mastered the NY
 C comedy scene performing at the world-renowned Comedy Cellar\, New  York 
 Comedy Club\, and Gotham Comedy Club\, among others.\n\nPlease Note: Thursd
 ay's show will take place in the Main Room. Friday through Sunday will take
  place in Room 861.\n\nCouple's Package includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $
 90 food & beverage credit ($45 per person)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection
